{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 1925 - a lone sorceress named Crystal Piquet is called to a mysterious abandoned &quot;magical&quot; mansion. Most never <i>dared</i> to step foot near it since it appeared about a year ago, and those who did never came back... However, Crystal is determined to improve her magical abilities and begins her journey to the cursed mansion....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using her magical<strong>\u00a0CARD BASED MAGIC</strong>, Crystal fights her way through monsters and ghouls to reach the top of the mansion, where she believes a secret that could help her become stronger lies in wait....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you up to the task to trek this cursed mansion...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the halls of the mansion in<strong> EXPLORE MODE</strong>, solving puzzles and clearing obstacles in your way. Search furnature to find<strong> </strong><i>Gears</i>\u00a0and other machanical tools to assist on your journey, but they aren't the only things hiding in the mansion...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963010/extras/52872bd4cdca60700e50e2dd68c43a07.avif?t=1758090902\" alt=\"Explore!\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way forward in<strong> BATTLE MODE</strong>, using a card-based battle system where magical cards are collected and harnessed for combat! Total higher numbers together to pack higher punches, and level up to unlock over 20 unique<i> Special Cards</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963010/extras/5b8c903663ab35ce1c17164c747d2972.avif?t=1758090902\" alt=\"Battle!\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets of the mansion and your own abilities in Team Wowasaurs<i><strong> Wraith of the Cards</strong></i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963010?t=1758090902","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963010?t=1758090902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963010/e6dbb1f024fbbd339cd618e552a3e6e9aef7b6f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758090902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963010/e6dbb1f024fbbd339cd618e552a3e6e9aef7b6f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758090902","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 1925 - a lone sorceress named Crystal Piquet is called to a mysterious abandoned &quot;magical&quot; mansion. Most never <i>dared</i> to step foot near it since it appeared about a year ago, and those who did never came back... However, Crystal is determined to improve her magical abilities and begins her journey to the cursed mansion....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using her magical<strong>\u00a0CARD BASED MAGIC</strong>, Crystal fights her way through monsters and ghouls to reach the top of the mansion, where she believes a secret that could help her become stronger lies in wait....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you up to the task to trek this cursed mansion...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the halls of the mansion in<strong> EXPLORE MODE</strong>, solving puzzles and clearing obstacles in your way. Search furnature to find<strong> </strong><i>Gears</i>\u00a0and other machanical tools to assist on your journey, but they aren't the only things hiding in the mansion...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_c